  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• To a medium saucepan, add coconut milk, the water (for the rice) and a generous pinch of salt and bring to the boil.\n• Add basmati rice, stir, cover with a lid and reduce heat to low.\n• Cook for 15 minutes, then remove the pan from heat and keep covered until the rice is tender and the water is absorbed, 10 minutes. TIP: The rice will finish cooking in its own steam, so don’t peek!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67846cc2f2efe8ce609915e8-b72df9a6.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, finely chop garlic. Roughly chop tomato and cucumber. Cut lime into wedges. Drain sweetcorn. Drain and rinse red kidney beans.\n• Heat a large frying pan over a high heat. Cook sweetcorn until lightly charred, 4-5 minutes. Transfer to a medium bowl. TIP: Cover the pan with a lid if the corn kernels are ‘popping’ out.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67846cc2f2efe8ce609915e8-130d31cb.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Return frying pan to medium-high heat. Cook kidney beans until softened, 2-3 minutes. Add garlic, tomato paste and mild Caribbean jerk seasoning and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Add the water (for the sauce) and a pinch of sugar and simmer until slightly thickened, 1-2 minutes. Remove from the heat and season to taste.\n• Meanwhile, to the bowl with the corn, add tomato and cucumber. Add a good squeeze of lime juice and a drizzle of olive oil. Toss to coat. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67846cc2f2efe8ce609915e8-4bc3670a.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Pick and roughly chop mint.\n• Divide coconut rice and Caribbean beans between bowls. Top with the tomato-corn salsa. Garnish with mint.\n• Serve with plant-based aioli and any remaining lime wedges. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67846cc2f2efe8ce609915e8-e5bbc65a.jpeg"
    }
  ]
